==Event Information==
"BitSummit Let's Go!" will be held from July 14th (Friday) to July 16th (Sunday) at Kyoto Museum of Traditional Crafts "Miyako Messe", "Nyanko Daisensou" will be exhibited!<br>
To commemorate the event, a limited time sponsored commemorative event will be held!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''The event is scheduled to run from July 13th, 2023 (11:00) to July 16th, 2023 (23:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FBBC04|'''●Commemorative Stage "Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!" is held!'''}}<br>
During the event period, go to Legend Story (Event Stage) from the "Nyanko Daisensou" app title screen and tap the "Start Battle!!" button, the "Sponsored BitSummit Commemoration!" will appear!

Clear the stages and get {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Rare Tickets'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※If you cannot see the stage "Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!", you need to update your app to the latest version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FBBC04|'''●Commemorative login bonus appears!'''}}<br>
Log in during the following period and receive {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''11 Cat Food'''}} one time only!<br>
Don't forget to log in!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''The event is scheduled to run from July 13th, 2023 (0:00) to July 16th, 2023 (23:59)!'''}}

<small><small>※You must update your app to the latest version to receive the login bonus.</small></small>

In addition, the "BitSummit Let's Go!" Real Nyanko Daisensou Photo Spot will be launched at the Ponos booth on the day of the event!<br>
Check out the hashtag "[https://twitter.com/hashtag/リアルにゃんこ大戦争 #RealNyankoDaisensou]" on Twitter to see how the event went!

Learn more about "BitSummit Let's Go!" Click here for more information<br>
https://bitsummit.org/

